  "dom_id": "questionExplanation-101832",
  "name": null,
  "problem": "",
  "worked_solution": "We need to isolate all terms with $f$ on one side of the equation. To do this, we start by subtracting $1$ from both sides: \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}1-3fg & =2f-1 \\\\ 1-3fg-1 & =2f-1-1 \\\\ -3fg & =2f-2\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNext, we subtract $2f$ from both sides of the equation:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}-3fg & =2f-2 \\\\ -3fg-2f & =2f-2-2f \\\\ -3fg-2f & =-2\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNotice that all terms containing $f$ are on the left-hand side, and all terms independent of $f$ are on the right-hand side.\n\nNext, we factor out $f$ in the expression on the left-hand side.\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}-3fg-2f & =-2 \\\\ f(-3g-2) & =-2\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFinally, we divide both sides by $(-3g-2)$ to isolate $f:$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}f(-3g-2) & =-2 \\\\ \\frac{f(-3g-2)}{-3g-2} & =\\frac{-2}{-3g-2} \\\\ \\frac{f\\cancel{(-3g-2)}}{\\cancel{-3g-2}} & =\\frac{-2}{-(3g+2)} \\\\ f & =\\frac{2}{3g+2}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\n**Note:** This result assumes that $3g+2\\ne 0.$",
  "calculator_instructions": "",
  "fields": [],
  "problem_field_keys": [],
  "answer_fields_complete": null,
  "result": null,
  "proof_feedback": null,
  "html": "<div id=\"questionExplanation-101832\" class=\"questionExplanation\" style=\"display: block;\"><p>We need to isolate all terms with <mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"3\" style=\"font-size: 113.1%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D453 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container> on one side of the equation. To do this, we start by subtracting <mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"4\" style=\"font-size: 113.1%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c31\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>1</mn></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container> from both sides: </p>\n<p><mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" display=\"true\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"5\" style=\"font-size: 113.1%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math display=\"true\" class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\" style=\"margin-left: 0px; margin-right: 0px;\"><mjx-mtable style=\"min-width: 10.8em;\"><mjx-table><mjx-itable><mjx-mtr><mjx-mtd style=\"text-align: right; padding-right: 0px; padding-bottom: 0.4em;\"><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c31\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"3\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2212\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"3\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c33\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D453 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D454 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-tstrut></mjx-tstrut></mjx-mtd><mjx-mtd style=\"text-al