><mjx-tstrut></mjx-tstrut></mjx-mtd></mjx-mtr></mjx-itable></mjx-table></mjx-mtable></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"block\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><mtable displaystyle=\"true\" columnalign=\"right left\" columnspacing=\"0em\" rowspacing=\"0.8em 0.8em 0.3em\"><mtr><mtd><mo>−</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>f</mi><mi>g</mi></mtd><mtd><mi></mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>f</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mo>−</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>f</mi><mi>g</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>f</mi></mtd><mtd><mi></mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>f</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>f</mi></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mo>−</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>f</mi><mi>g</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>f</mi></mtd><mtd><mi></mi><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn></mtd></mtr></mtable></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container></p>\n<p>Notice that all terms containing <mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"8\" style=\"font-size: 113.1%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D453 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container> are on the left-hand side, and all terms independent of <mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"9\" style=\"font-size: 113.1%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D453 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container> are on the right-hand side.</p>\n<p>Next, we factor out <mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_